// CheckZoneWithResponse Report what is wrong with a zone as it stands
//
// Every rule the write path enforces, applied to the zone as it is
// stored.
//
// A write is checked against the names it touches, and against the names
// a new delegation would put out of reach, so a zone edited only through
// this API stays sound. What this finds is what did not arrive that way:
// data written before a rule existed, or a hand on the database file.
